  "captureRequires": "OLD_STOPPED_QUIESCENT produced by exact stopOld OUTCOME, with same old ID/daemon/volume/fence and authenticated process/descendant quiescence. Restart=no alone NEVER qualifies.",
  "failureRules": "failure record may originate at ANY phase including SEALED/restore/READY; transition to BLOCKED_FORWARD_ONLY or QUIESCENCE_UNKNOWN. A repeated failure observation in a blocked phase may remain there, with no effect. Original seal/inventory refs and history flags must remain exact if they ever existed. No clear/reset/drop to satisfy schema.",
  "reentry": "same first-plan request only; unknown BLOCK; no second migration; normal3 new lease validates immutable seals + current M2 without freezing migration P/H/C",
  "lockOrder": "external auth -> acquire OS locks PC2 thenPC4 by registered daemon/root sort order -> durable logical lease CAS against prior fence while both locks held -> effects. On CAS conflict release only newly acquired locks after no-effect/child proof. Release: stop new children -> prove all descendants quiescent -> durable RELEASED logical CAS under both locks -> unlock PC4 thenPC2.",
  "nestedReentrancy": "Only live matching operation/token hash/owner generation/OS-lock registry may reuse held locks via trusted internal context and reference count. No recursive reacquisition, lock upgrade, caller asserted owned flag or taking another owner; mismatch BLOCK.",
  "unknownOwnership": "no PID/age/expiry reclaim or stale eviction",
  "secondMigrationAllowed": false
}
